    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just so scary thinking about it. i noticed my manager has been avoiding eye contact with me lately too, and every time i sit in the breakroom, people suddenly stop talking. i feel like i'm being watched every second. if i start keeping these notes, do you think they'll notice and try to escalate the pressure? like, how can i protect myself if they realize i'm onto them?",
